      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cumberland_City%2C_Tennessee"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town sits at 36°23′26″N 87°38′27″W, placing it just north of the Cumberland River in Stewart County.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cumberland_City%2C_Tennessee"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "South of the fossil plant lies a small impact crater centered at Wells Creek, a rare geological feature in the area.",
